Chapter: MagicCardGenDraws
  cites Foreword chapter Console
  cites Magic chapter Card
  cites Magic chapter CardGen

 CardGen's generators print what they draw, so a change of generator shows
 as a change of card here. `apps/games/magic/Test.codex` calls the same
 generators and never reaches them: it dies earlier.

 We say:

Section: Body

  line : Text, GenResult -> Text
  line (tag) (r) =
    tag & ": " & (r.card).name & " " & show ((r.card).power) & "/" & show ((r.card).toughness)

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    let a = gen-red-creature (gen-config-new 42)
    in let b = gen-green-creature (gen-config-new 100)
    in let c = gen-blue-spell (gen-config-new 55)
    in let d = gen-red-creature (gen-config-new 43)
    in act
      print-line-uni (line "red 42" a)
      print-line-uni (line "green 100" b)
      print-line-uni ("blue 55: " & (c.card).name)
      print-line-uni (line "red 43" d)
    end
  end

